@startuml target_help_global_classes
title Recommended Global Command Structure - Confirmed Agent Help
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/MateServiceClient.java AgentRuntime.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/AgentRuntimeManager.java prepareCached, toIdentity:630, toRuntime:646, AgentIdentity:717.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/PreparedAgentRuntime.java metadata.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/command/execution/CommandExecutionContext.java session and catalog.
' Observed behavior: upstream AgentRuntime has userCases, but the local identity omits it and reload supplies an empty list.
' Design reason: keep the whole command structure visible while Help projects authored Agent metadata, not command descriptors.
' Product constraint: Help explains the Agent; Slash discovery remains in the command catalog.
' Target-only: confirmed assembly is not implemented; existing SPI and Runtime collaborators are reused.

package "Web boundary" as Web {
  class RuntimeCommandController {
    +list(sessionId)
    +execute(sessionId, request)
  }
  class "Command Request VOs\nImmutable Response VOs" as CommandVOs
  class HelpResultResponseVO <<immutable response>> #E3F2E1 {
    command = help
    displayName
    description[]
    userCases[]
  }
}
package "Application layer" as Application {
  class CommandCatalogService
  class CommandExecutionService
  class CommandResponseAssembler
  class AgentHelpQueryService #E3F2E1 {
    +query(agentId): AgentHelpDTO
  }
  class "AgentHelpDTO / HelpResultDTO" as HelpData <<immutable request data>> #E3F2E1
}
package "Command core" as Core {
  class CompositeCommandRegistry
  class ResolvedCommandCatalog <<request snapshot>>
  interface CommandDefinitionSource
  class BuiltinCommandSource
  class SkillCommandSource
  interface BuiltinCommandContributor
  class BuiltinCommandDefinition
  interface CommandHandler
  interface CommandAdmissionPolicy
}
package "Builtin adapters - singleton" as Adapters {
  class "HelpContributor + 6 Contributors" as Contributors
  class HelpCommandHandler #E3F2E1
  class "6 Other Builtin Handlers\nand Narrow Services" as OtherBuiltins
}
package "Runtime and persistence" as Runtime {
  class AgentRuntimeManager {
    +prepareCached(agentId): PreparedAgentRuntime
  }
  class PreparedAgentRuntime <<query snapshot>> #E3F2E1
  class "AgentIdentity\nagent.json" as AgentIdentity <<stored metadata>> #E3F2E1 {
    name / displayName
    description[]
    userCases[] (retain on reload)
  }
  class MateServiceClient
  class "Runtime execution / Repository" as RuntimePorts <<grouped>>
}

RuntimeCommandController -[norank]-> CommandCatalogService
RuntimeCommandController -[norank]-> CommandExecutionService
RuntimeCommandController -[dashed,norank]-> CommandVOs
CommandCatalogService -[norank]-> CompositeCommandRegistry
CommandCatalogService -[dashed,norank]-> CommandVOs
CommandExecutionService -[norank]-> CompositeCommandRegistry
CommandExecutionService -[norank]-> CommandResponseAssembler
CommandResponseAssembler -[dashed,norank]-> CommandVOs
CommandResponseAssembler -[dashed,norank]-> HelpData
CommandResponseAssembler -[dashed,norank]-> HelpResultResponseVO
CompositeCommandRegistry o-[norank]- "1..*" CommandDefinitionSource
BuiltinCommandSource -[dashed,norank]-|> CommandDefinitionSource
SkillCommandSource -[dashed,norank]-|> CommandDefinitionSource
CompositeCommandRegistry -[norank]-> ResolvedCommandCatalog : one resolution
BuiltinCommandSource o-[norank]- "7" BuiltinCommandContributor
Contributors -[dashed,norank]-|> BuiltinCommandContributor
BuiltinCommandContributor -[norank]-> BuiltinCommandDefinition : contributes
ResolvedCommandCatalog o-[norank]- "0..*" BuiltinCommandDefinition : selected Builtin view
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-[norank]- "1" CommandHandler
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-[norank]- "1" CommandAdmissionPolicy
CommandExecutionService -[norank]-> BuiltinCommandDefinition : select / admit / execute
HelpCommandHandler -[dashed,norank]-|> CommandHandler
OtherBuiltins -[dashed,norank]-|> CommandHandler
Contributors -[norank]-> HelpCommandHandler : Help binding
Contributors -[norank]-> OtherBuiltins : other bindings
HelpCommandHandler -[norank]-> AgentHelpQueryService : authorized Session agentId
AgentHelpQueryService -[dashed,norank]-> HelpData : whitelist projection
AgentHelpQueryService -[norank]-> AgentRuntimeManager : prepareCached once
AgentRuntimeManager -[norank]-> PreparedAgentRuntime : load complete snapshot
AgentRuntimeManager -[norank]-> AgentIdentity : publish / reload userCases
AgentRuntimeManager -[norank]-> MateServiceClient : existing explicit refresh only
SkillCommandSource -[norank]-> AgentRuntimeManager
OtherBuiltins -[norank]-> RuntimePorts
CommandExecutionService -[norank]-> RuntimePorts : Session access

RuntimeCommandController -[hidden]right-> CommandVOs
CommandVOs -[hidden]right-> HelpResultResponseVO
RuntimeCommandController -[hidden]down-> CommandCatalogService
CommandCatalogService -[hidden]right-> CommandExecutionService
CommandExecutionService -[hidden]right-> CommandResponseAssembler
CommandCatalogService -[hidden]down-> AgentHelpQueryService
AgentHelpQueryService -[hidden]right-> HelpData
AgentHelpQueryService -[hidden]down-> CompositeCommandRegistry
CompositeCommandRegistry -[hidden]right-> ResolvedCommandCatalog
ResolvedCommandCatalog -[hidden]right-> BuiltinCommandDefinition
CompositeCommandRegistry -[hidden]down-> CommandDefinitionSource
CommandDefinitionSource -[hidden]right-> BuiltinCommandSource
BuiltinCommandSource -[hidden]right-> SkillCommandSource
CommandDefinitionSource -[hidden]down-> BuiltinCommandContributor
BuiltinCommandContributor -[hidden]right-> CommandHandler
CommandHandler -[hidden]right-> CommandAdmissionPolicy
BuiltinCommandContributor -[hidden]down-> Contributors
Contributors -[hidden]right-> HelpCommandHandler
HelpCommandHandler -[hidden]right-> OtherBuiltins
Contributors -[hidden]down-> AgentRuntimeManager
AgentRuntimeManager -[hidden]right-> PreparedAgentRuntime
PreparedAgentRuntime -[hidden]right-> AgentIdentity
AgentRuntimeManager -[hidden]down-> MateServiceClient
MateServiceClient -[hidden]right-> RuntimePorts

legend bottom left
Confirmed target-only global design; green marks the Help metadata path.
Repeated collaborators are grouped, not omitted.
Help has no catalog formatting, model call, or refresh.
Help exposes no prompt or binding details; reads serialize with Agent publication.
Core/application services are singleton; response data is request-scoped.
HelpData belongs to runtimeapi.dto.command, not the Service package.
AgentHelpQueryService belongs to runtimeapi.service.command.
RuntimePorts includes singleton services and execution-scoped Session objects.
endlegend
@enduml
